<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Uganda and Ethiopia are completing long-term withdrawals of their troops from Somalia, while the African Union is pulling out from four Lower Shabelle bases. The United States and an East African nation have begun joint airstrikes against a $100 million-earning al-Qaeda linked group, and the UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year. Mawisley militias have pulled back from central front lines, whereas Puntland mercenaries are fighting alongside Sudanese RSF forces, and Sudan’s army reports northern Somali fighters supporting the RSF. Somali pirates seized an Iranian fishing vessel, rescuing seven Pakistani crew members. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxON1NUWFFwY2dfX002Nm40NWVSdlROclFWazV4X3hGd2hIQ1FNMndwRlNmTVRnZ2lGbjNza3hxSEhLaFFVaWxZTVRrWDFvR3hkTkdCR3V4X0s5MTlRbmJxeS0wRlBrcFI5MzljaE55cFBuQVlaS19rTXVDS19vSjFKZGFET0pyNVhBZFJWaC1QUUF0VHg5T1BxRWZ4WV_SAZwBQVVfeXFMTkV4RXZxSkhTYmdkdVV5UVl1SXlNUTNaRFFBZVdINTBCMHdJdUtJRHBlX1gxendROHhXeFJ5d3htWkdVQVpnQzRoOFZlQjIyRG10T0dGbGdfdTNyaFowdzJya2U2UVR6U0xBN05TSlFQRURWaXRXM1UwMjV3T2daVWtfWUY2a2NSaGNfdFZkVmRiWWhQWjBIcm55OWlI?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5OLTVsNnI2UzI5b2RxaXRoc3g0ZWU4bXhYSzliS3FPWUc5a0VCbmR1cnhWNXRPN0JsUlU2QmZGWXBIblQ2bUFOTGpVdUdNY0phYlgyU1piRHN4Q0c0N0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNRW1uaUU5WXhKVm01enNpR0k2ajFWdHEzQ21fTmMzcVBHcGFaQ1BVRl85YzBIeHBjUlJONTVaMWR1RVM0ZXRFREZfaVRQSlk5MnYycUcxaUQ4WXJscjhBQjNzbzYyYTJERUo5enZXLXk1RGlJR